# HR: New hire onboarding packet check

Load examples/business/data/onboarding_packet.txt as Onboarding Packet
Alias Onboarding Packet as Packet

require employee name
require start date
require manager
check for equipment request

Find offer letter and save as offer_letter

If offer_letter is missing
  packet_status equals "incomplete"
Otherwise
  packet_status equals "ready"

Route packet_status to hr_onboarding_queue
